+    /* Meridian (HoldWindowsOffscreen): ordering in or focusing a window that
+       is off every screen makes Cocoa carry it onto one (-[NSWindow
+       _positionWindowOnBestScreen], through -setFrame:display:). While these
+       run, a held window refuses that move. Moves from outside
